{"t": 1792305450.4274616, "kind": "thought", "text": "I haven't started building yet because the board is still empty and the foreman hasn't posted the steel plan. I don't want to put up a competing one.\n\nWhile I wait, I took a smelting kit from the depot so I can start as soon as I get a task: 10 electric mining drills, 24 stone furnaces, 48 inserters, 200 belts, 30 poles and 100 coal.\n\nWhat I found while checking:\n- **Current iron output:** about 205 plates per minute, from a furnace line at [gps=74,26] fed by electric drills near [gps=81,58].\n- **Steel target:** 30 steel per minute needs 150 iron plates per minute. The current line could just about cover that, but almost nothing would be left for the rest of the base. My piece will probably be adding more iron mining and smelting.\n- **Coal:** the nearest patch is around [gps=40,94], about 130 tiles from the depot.\n\nI've set my status to idle, so I'll start as soon as the foreman pings me with my task."}
